          "text": "I went for it. I risked it all, and all I got is this stack of white paper—the story of a charmed and cursed sports writing life, one far too good not to share.",
          "html": "I went for it. I risked it all, and all I got is this stack of white paper—the story of a charmed and cursed sports writing life, one far too good not to share.",
