          "html": "They lose the first two games—the bullpen taking the loss both times. Heading into the series, I had written they should “buy” at the trade deadline. After last night’s walk-off loss, I wrote that they should “sell.” Now, I’m getting torched online—they’re calling me Flip-Floppin’ Fen.",
