          "html": "<em>July 29</em>—They avoid the sweep with a win on Getaway Day. In the clubhouse afterwards—two days until the trade deadline—the players try to put a positive spin on things. Verlander hopes his performance (8 innings, 1 run, 10 strikeouts) helps the front office believe there’s a chance. I linger after the scrum and comment on his suede jacket, trying to get on his good side.",
