          "id": "p_ch17_029",
          "text": "CLEVELAND, June 24—Sandwiched between Tigers Twitter Guy and Seamhead John Lowe, who joined us after Sunday service, church program in tote.",
          "html": "CLEVELAND, <em>June 24</em>—Sandwiched between Tigers Twitter Guy and Seamhead John Lowe, who joined us after Sunday service, church program in tote.",
