          "text": "So, here I am. Walking into the Astros clubhouse to find Alex Bregman. Responding to my August 4 report, which said two years ago Detroit rebuffed Houston’s efforts to trade for Michael Fulmer using Bregman as the centerpiece, the cocksure superstar tweeted, “Nah, false.”",
          "html": "So, here I am. Walking into the Astros clubhouse to find Alex Bregman. Responding to my August 4 report, which said two years ago Detroit rebuffed Houston’s efforts to trade for Michael Fulmer using Bregman as the centerpiece, the cocksure superstar tweeted, “Nah, false.”",
