          "text": "9:27 P.M.—Trying to get social media attention, the Freep Twitter account sends a cute breaking news tweet, extra-cheeky and factually incorrect, linking to my game story:",
          "html": "9:27 P.M.—Trying to get social media attention, the <em>Freep</em> Twitter account sends a cute breaking news tweet, extra-cheeky and factually incorrect, linking to my game story:",
